# Monorepo Boundaries

- Never import between apps. Shared logic belongs in packages.
- Use `workspace:*` for internal packages and `catalog:` for external dependencies.
- Package exports must match actual build outputs. Do not declare broken `main`, `types`, or subpath exports.
- Prefer single-file lint, type-check, format, and test commands before broad workspace runs.
- Changes to shared packages must consider downstream app consumers and package entrypoints.
